#: 0d4e5484a81949adb802e1dc0a1aa0dd
msgid "Whole-body mode (`/mode_command`)"
msgstr "全身模式（`/mode_command`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:195
#: ce542c5fa0084558b623fd4c94595331
msgid ""
"`/mode_command` is **`std_msgs/String`** on the **全身 / WBC** stack. It is "
"not `/fsm_command`. Same availability as the body/head Cartesian topics "
"above: 分体 and default mock demos do not start this path. Typical Python: "
"`send_mode_command`, then `wait_until_mode_commands_applied` against "
"`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` "
"(`arms_ros2_control_msgs/WbcCurrentState`). The FSM is usually already "
"**OCS2**, or the controller may ignore the mode. The Python interface maps "
"`HEAD_DISABLE`, `HEAD_TRACKING`, `HEAD_GAZE`, and `HEAD_FORWARD` onto "
"`head_state`."
msgstr ""
"`/mode_command` 是全身 / WBC 栈上的 **`std_msgs/String`**，不是 "
"`/fsm_command`。可用性与上文的身体/头部笛卡尔话题相同：分体和默认 mock 演示不会启动这条路径。典型的 Python 用法是先 "
"`send_mode_command`，再对照 "
"`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`（`arms_ros2_control_msgs/WbcCurrentState`）调用"
" `wait_until_mode_commands_applied`。FSM 通常需要已经处于 "
"**OCS2**，否则控制器可能忽略该模式。Python 接口会把 `HEAD_DISABLE`、`HEAD_TRACKING`、`HEAD_GAZE`"
" 和 `HEAD_FORWARD` 映射到 `head_state`。"


