#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:95
#: 4959e6efb0b6499aa84385c2fce768ee
msgid ""
"`ocs2_wbc_controller` runs from the `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` deb. "
"Extra FSM states stay in the source README. Which constraints are live "
"depends on the robot (`WbcCapability` in the [msgs "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md):"
" mobile base, body relative, head 6D, midpoint gaze, …). Public Taku mock"
" uses `split_body.launch.py robot:=taku` (arm MPC + body/head "
"`basic_joint_controller` + `adaptive_gripper_controller`). That is not "
"WBC. `full_body.launch.py robot:=taku` needs `ocs2_wbc_controller` from "
"that deb or from a source checkout. Shipping "
"`config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` in the public description is not "
"enough. When that config and the controller are installed, Taku full-body"
" default `headMode` is `HEAD_GAZE` (gaze on "
"`head_camera_mid_optical_frame`); `target_manager.yaml` has "
"`enable_head_control: false` so the head follows OCS2 rather than a "
"joint-space marker. Split-body still teleops the head through "
"`head_joint_controller`. Taku body-relative rest is around x≈−0.21, not "
"Bot2 `[0, 0.25]`. Head 6D tracking (`HEAD_TRACKING`) is only there when "
"the controller reports `head_tracking_ee_enabled`."
msgstr ""
"`ocs2_wbc_controller` 从 `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` 这个 deb 运行。多出来的 FSM "
"状态留在源码 README。哪些约束在生效取决于这台机器人（[消息 README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)"
" 里的 `WbcCapability`：移动底盘、身体相对、头部 6D、中点注视等）。公开的 Taku mock 用 "
"`split_body.launch.py robot:=taku`（手臂 MPC + 身体/头部 "
"`basic_joint_controller` + `adaptive_gripper_controller`）。那不是 "
"WBC。`full_body.launch.py robot:=taku` 需要这个 deb 里的 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`，或一份源码检出。公开描述里带 `config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` "
"不够。配置和控制器都装上之后，Taku 全身模式默认 `headMode` 是 `HEAD_GAZE`（注视 "
"`head_camera_mid_optical_frame`）；`target_manager.yaml` 里 "
"`enable_head_control: false`，头跟随 OCS2，而不是关节空间里的标记。分体模式仍通过 "
"`head_joint_controller` 遥操作头部。Taku 相对身体的静止位置大约在 x≈−0.21，不是 Bot2 的 `[0, "
"0.25]`。头部 6D 跟踪（`HEAD_TRACKING`）只在控制器报告 `head_tracking_ee_enabled` 时才有。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:206
#: 45bf2e65de6f47b994a07699a1ffacd3
msgid "Read the current WBC modes (`current_state`)"
msgstr "查看当前全身控制模式（`current_state`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:208
#: e42deb44e2b1452ea8c1e00488cc0d99
msgid ""
"Subscribe to `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` to see the modes reported "
"by the whole-body controller. The message type is "
"`arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/WbcCurrentState`. These fields describe WBC "
"modes and constraints, not joint positions or motion completion. They are "
"separate from the FSM state on `/fsm_state`."
msgstr ""
"订阅 `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` 可以查看全身控制器反馈的模式，消息类型是 "
"`arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/WbcCurrentState`。这些字段表示 WBC "
"的模式和约束，不表示关节位置或运动是否完成，也不是 `/fsm_state` 中的控制器状态。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:210
#: 08090581666f4c8cb94de1870d54e00b
msgid ""
"With the whole-body controller running and its workspace sourced, inspect "
"the feedback and the installed message definition:"
msgstr "启动全身控制器并 source 对应工作空间后，可以查看状态反馈和本机安装的消息定义："

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:212
#: 78e4da3426f54a19b681a4d26ae50cac
msgid ""
"ros2 topic echo /ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state\n"
"ros2 interface show arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/WbcCurrentState\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 topic echo /ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state\n"
"ros2 interface show arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/WbcCurrentState\n"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:217
#: b6e02e2d494b45eaad1adbb281fe3df1
msgid ""
"If the controller runs in a namespace, use its actual topic name. The fields"
" below follow the current [message definition](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/WbcCurrentState.msg)"
" and [message package README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"控制器带命名空间时，请使用实际的话题名。下面的字段以当前[消息定义](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/WbcCurrentState.msg)和[消息包"
" README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md) "
"为依据。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: 029392dd0143474aaa81af5783749c22
msgid "Values and meaning"
msgstr "取值与含义"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: 48d57aed7afc4c7893c83fa1d07ef97e 3bd090b330474341ac6ca252d5ba62f5
#: cfd8b08ec57c408da9e3ec611758f667 12ea7e137bd74471b8ff9b7d768c6a59
#: 02fcdeae40724d13b8db410152d8ff22 a145af394f744ba0a9e166290dd74ff1
msgid "`uint8`"
msgstr "`uint8`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: b9ed82ed8adf4cae8d3cca9b23b6f6cc
msgid ""
"Base mode: `0` = `BASE_LOCKED` (locked); `1` = `BASE_UNLOCKED` (unlocked)."
msgstr "底盘模式：`0` 为 `BASE_LOCKED`（锁定），`1` 为 `BASE_UNLOCKED`（解锁）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: e113e426b9dc4b72b86038f577af117a
msgid ""
"Selected body mode: `0` = `BODY_FREE` (free); `1` = `BODY_VERTICAL` "
"(vertical); `2` = `BODY_TRACKING` (tracking); `3` = `BODY_LOCKED` (locked); "
"`5` = `BODY_CUSTOM_LOCKED` (custom joint lock). The former lock-head value "
"`4` is no longer published."
msgstr ""
"选择的身体模式：`0` 为 `BODY_FREE`（自由），`1` 为 `BODY_VERTICAL`（竖直），`2` 为 "
"`BODY_TRACKING`（跟随），`3` 为 `BODY_LOCKED`（锁定），`5` 为 "
"`BODY_CUSTOM_LOCKED`（自定义关节锁定）。旧的锁头值 `4` 已不再发布。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: b31cf8d388cc48e0981a50193169eeea
msgid ""
"Arm coordination: `0` = `BIMANUAL_INDEPENDENT` (independent); `1` = "
"`BIMANUAL_COUPLED` (coupled)."
msgstr "双臂协同模式：`0` 为 `BIMANUAL_INDEPENDENT`（独立），`1` 为 `BIMANUAL_COUPLED`（耦合）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: e23afc754ad74c2392ac5801887be0e9
msgid "`left_arm_state`"
msgstr "`left_arm_state`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: fbc2ac61a8dc44278f03e4a7cdb89e49
msgid ""
"Left arm in WBC: `0` = `ARM_DISABLED` (disabled); `1` = `ARM_ENABLED` "
"(enabled)."
msgstr "WBC 中的左臂状态：`0` 为 `ARM_DISABLED`（禁用），`1` 为 `ARM_ENABLED`（启用）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: fef0e3d128e847af8224332b2a363de1
msgid "`right_arm_state`"
msgstr "`right_arm_state`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: 51ae4c74ae0b4ac3983d1dc2c06e2b96
msgid ""
"Right arm in WBC: `0` = `ARM_DISABLED` (disabled); `1` = `ARM_ENABLED` "
"(enabled)."
msgstr "WBC 中的右臂状态：`0` 为 `ARM_DISABLED`（禁用），`1` 为 `ARM_ENABLED`（启用）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: 79f0394d89c94a6d9d451ba595520816
msgid "`home_joint_reference_enabled`"
msgstr "`home_joint_reference_enabled`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: d7427c4faa9f4b2a9c1a1b40bf62f7f9 c5a9284c9e5f48b7b6cbe26465207f23
msgid "`bool`"
msgstr "`bool`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: a7845890ba6047cc9f7ba0bb0e1e25de
msgid ""
"Whether the HOME joint-reference constraint is on: `true` = on; `false` = "
"off. This is a constraint switch, not a report that the FSM is in HOME."
msgstr "HOME 关节参考约束是否打开：`true` 为打开，`false` 为关闭。这是约束开关，不表示 FSM 处于 HOME 状态。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: 3ac91168d0cf4aedae519b5982b01c3e
msgid ""
"Head mode: `0` = `HEAD_DISABLED` (disabled); `1` = `HEAD_TRACKING` (6D pose "
"tracking); `2` = `HEAD_GAZE` (gaze at the midpoint between the two end "
"effectors); `3` = `HEAD_FORWARD` (the former lock-head head/waist coupling "
"and waist constraints)."
msgstr ""
"头部模式：`0` 为 `HEAD_DISABLED`（禁用），`1` 为 `HEAD_TRACKING`（六维位姿跟踪），`2` 为 "
"`HEAD_GAZE`（注视双手末端中点），`3` 为 `HEAD_FORWARD`（原锁头模式的头腰联动及腰部约束）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: 0e02ff0e493f42e9b99a8b4eb68fdf42
msgid "`head_midpoint_gaze_active`"
msgstr "`head_midpoint_gaze_active`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: 528b99f76a8042feb3cf1e36a5aea1ff
msgid ""
"Whether midpoint gaze is active. It is `true` only while `HEAD_GAZE` is "
"active, independently of the selected body mode. It does not guarantee that "
"the head is aligned with the target or that the target is reachable."
msgstr ""
"双手末端中点注视任务是否激活。只有 `HEAD_GAZE` 生效时才为 `true`，与选择的身体模式无关。它不保证头部已经对准目标，也不保证目标可达。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:230
#: b5537a51b1cf4818b5712b1136b1a304
msgid "Interpret the feedback"
msgstr "怎样判断状态"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:232
#: e8042c932a5041c7a076bd684424f16b
msgid ""
"In `HEAD_FORWARD`, `body_state` still reports the body mode you selected, "
"but the former lock-head constraints temporarily override it. Leaving "
"`HEAD_FORWARD` restores that body selection. Read `head_state` together with"
" `body_state` rather than treating the body field alone as the active "
"constraint set."
msgstr ""
"处于 `HEAD_FORWARD` 时，`body_state` 仍反馈之前选择的身体模式，但实际约束暂时由原锁头约束覆盖；退出 "
"`HEAD_FORWARD` 后恢复该身体选择。因此，判断当前约束时要同时看 `head_state` 和 `body_state`，不能只看身体字段。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:234
#: cc72aa12bdc04fbbb2c11cadd66d65bf
msgid ""
"Capabilities and active states answer different questions. "
"`WbcCapability.head_midpoint_gaze_enabled` tells you whether midpoint gaze "
"is configured; `WbcCurrentState.head_midpoint_gaze_active` tells you whether"
" the task is active now. Likewise, `WbcCapability.has_home_joint_reference` "
"indicates support for the HOME joint-reference constraint, while "
"`home_joint_reference_enabled` reports its current switch state."
msgstr ""
"能力和当前状态回答的是不同问题。`WbcCapability.head_midpoint_gaze_enabled` "
"表示是否配置了中点注视能力，`WbcCurrentState.head_midpoint_gaze_active` "
"表示此刻是否激活了该任务。同样，`WbcCapability.has_home_joint_reference` 表示是否支持 HOME "
"关节参考约束，`home_joint_reference_enabled` 则表示当前是否打开。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:236
#: 1441b5e964954560b812ffe3f090f1b6
msgid ""
"After a mode request, check the corresponding feedback field instead of "
"assuming that publishing a command means it was applied. For example, "
"`base_state: 0` reports a locked base, and `head_state: 2` with "
"`head_midpoint_gaze_active: true` reports an active midpoint-gaze task, not "
"that the head is already aligned."
msgstr ""
"发送模式请求后，要检查对应的反馈字段，不要把“命令已发出”当作“模式已生效”。例如，`base_state: 0` "
"表示底盘处于锁定模式；`head_state: 2` 且 `head_midpoint_gaze_active: true` "
"表示中点注视任务已激活，而不是头部已经对准。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:238
#: 609facaf37d04790b436d775451cb66b
msgid ""
"If the installed definition differs from this table, check the message "
"package version. After a message upgrade, rebuild the dependent source "
"packages as needed and source the updated workspace before restarting "
"publishers and subscribers with matching interfaces."
msgstr ""
"如果本机消息定义与表格不同，请先核对消息包版本。升级消息定义后，按需重新构建依赖它的源码包，source "
"更新后的工作空间，再重新启动发布端和订阅端，让两端使用一致的接口。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:175
#: 18415377487f48cf99e9dcb2f17c574f
msgid "`HEAD_DISABLE` / `HEAD_TRACKING` / `HEAD_GAZE` / `HEAD_FORWARD`"
msgstr "`HEAD_DISABLE` / `HEAD_TRACKING` / `HEAD_GAZE` / `HEAD_FORWARD`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:239
#: b9720c6164cf4370b5e9fe0030c01a54
msgid "Switch on midpoint gaze (`HEAD_GAZE`)"
msgstr "打开中点注视（`HEAD_GAZE`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:241
#: 414a6c11f2a34955b27cd0f51a8f0ca1
msgid ""
"Do not publish to `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`. That topic is "
"feedback. `head_state: 2` means `HEAD_GAZE`, and `head_midpoint_gaze_active`"
" becomes `true` only after that mode is active. It is not a separate "
"command."
msgstr ""
"不要向 `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` 发布。这个话题是状态反馈。`head_state: 2` 表示 "
"`HEAD_GAZE`，`head_midpoint_gaze_active` 只在该模式生效后才会变成 `true`，它不是一条单独的命令。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:243
#: 5ae28317356145e480fe5c8e3d290c63
msgid ""
"First confirm that midpoint gaze is configured: "
"`WbcCapability.head_midpoint_gaze_enabled` should be `true`. This capability"
" comes from the robot's OCS2 task `.info` file, in the top-level "
"`headMidpointGaze` section (`activate`, `cameraFrame`, and the camera "
"parameters). If the bit is false, the controller will not apply `HEAD_GAZE`."
" The FSM is usually already **OCS2**; otherwise the controller may ignore "
"the mode command."
msgstr ""
"先确认已经配置了中点注视：`WbcCapability.head_midpoint_gaze_enabled` 应为 `true`。该能力来自机器人 "
"OCS2 任务 `.info` 文件中的顶层 `headMidpointGaze` 段（`activate`、`cameraFrame` "
"以及相机参数）。如果该位为假，控制器不会应用 `HEAD_GAZE`。FSM 通常需要已经处于 **OCS2**，否则控制器可能忽略这条模式命令。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:245
#: 01e5db37f6144705bd822695bf3fd002
msgid "Then request the mode on `/mode_command`:"
msgstr "然后向 `/mode_command` 请求该模式："

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:247
#: de799cdc9ea94c4e970dff8a2cbda4e2
msgid ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /mode_command std_msgs/msg/String \"data: "
"'HEAD_GAZE'\"\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /mode_command std_msgs/msg/String \"data: "
"'HEAD_GAZE'\""

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:251
#: 9c9ba8c126e248929a75c89cc26ebd89
msgid ""
"Or in Python, call `send_mode_command(\"HEAD_GAZE\")`, then "
"`wait_until_mode_commands_applied([\"HEAD_GAZE\"])`. If the controller runs "
"in a namespace, use its actual topic name. The RViz OCS2 panel also offers "
"注视 (Gaze) when this capability is enabled."
msgstr ""
"在 Python 中，先调用 `send_mode_command(\"HEAD_GAZE\")`，再调用 "
"`wait_until_mode_commands_applied([\"HEAD_GAZE\"])`。控制器带命名空间时，请使用实际的话题名。能力开启时，RViz"
" 的 OCS2 面板里也有「注视」。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:253
#: 8766dd9820f744fcb305922dbbcf1a46
msgid ""
"When the command is accepted, `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` should "
"report `head_state: 2` (`HEAD_GAZE`) and `head_midpoint_gaze_active: true`. "
"That reports an active task, not that the head is already aligned or that "
"the target is reachable. Send `HEAD_DISABLE` to stop gaze. A worked sequence"
" is in the [mode-command check example](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/examples/test/01_mode_and_fsm/check_mode_commands.py)."
msgstr ""
"命令被接受后，`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` 应回报 `head_state: "
"2`（`HEAD_GAZE`）且 `head_midpoint_gaze_active: "
"true`。这表示任务已激活，不表示头部已经对准，也不表示目标可达。发送 `HEAD_DISABLE` "
"可停止注视。完整示例见[模式命令检查脚本](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/examples/test/01_mode_and_fsm/check_mode_commands.py)。"

#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:43
#: bde4786ea6e54e8d89cf32963a357cae
msgid "`/ocs2_wbc_controller/wbc_capabilities`"
msgstr "`/ocs2_wbc_controller/wbc_capabilities`"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:43
#: 4498415a8c9440a29deea51ece4178de
msgid "`arms_ros2_control_msgs/WbcCapability`"
msgstr "`arms_ros2_control_msgs/WbcCapability`"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:43
#: b77ed219be7347c584e9c79864539a4e
msgid "Which WBC constraints this robot has configured"
msgstr "该机器人已配置哪些 WBC 约束"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:195
#: 3677fd7e1aa04b0297e85a01bbad7aa5
msgid "Switch whole-body modes (`/mode_command`)"
msgstr "切换全身模式（`/mode_command`）"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:197
#: c1702a12fadf4b2692dc6bbfa99ac9ee
msgid ""
"`/mode_command` is **`std_msgs/String`** on the **全身 / WBC** stack. It is "
"not `/fsm_command`, and it is not a write path for "
"`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`. That topic is feedback only. Same "
"availability as the body/head Cartesian topics above: 分体 and default mock "
"demos do not start this path."
msgstr ""
"`/mode_command` 是全身 / WBC 栈上的 **`std_msgs/String`**。它不是 "
"`/fsm_command`，也不能用来向 `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` "
"写入；那个话题只是反馈。可用性与上文的身体/头部笛卡尔话题相同：分体和默认的 mock 演示不会启动这条路径。"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:199
#: 09c9fc62bff54b3f95812a59e0600bd6
msgid ""
"The usual sequence is: confirm that `ocs2_wbc_controller` is running, switch"
" the FSM to **OCS2** if it is not already there, publish the mode string, "
"then confirm the matching field on `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`. You"
" can also publish the mode while still in **HOLD** or **MOVEJ** and then "
"enter OCS2; entering OCS2 keeps the mode you already set. Leaving OCS2, or "
"activating the controller, restores the default mode."
msgstr ""
"通常做法是：先确认 `ocs2_wbc_controller` 已在运行，若 FSM 还不是 **OCS2** 就先切过去，再发布模式字符串，然后在 "
"`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` 上确认对应字段。也可以在仍处于 **HOLD** 或 **MOVEJ** "
"时先发布模式，再进入 OCS2；进入 OCS2 会保留你已经设好的模式。离开 OCS2，或激活控制器时，会恢复默认模式。"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:201
#: 9ebb8eaf9e46418c92456dfa5444ba42
msgid "First check whether the robot supports the mode you want:"
msgstr "先确认机器人是否支持你要的模式："


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:203
#: f876821fb7ff425da538dd690afab8ae
msgid "ros2 topic echo /ocs2_wbc_controller/wbc_capabilities\n"
msgstr "ros2 topic echo /ocs2_wbc_controller/wbc_capabilities\n"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:207
#: 2d5e6f1fd0d047a6a211483fd532554e
msgid ""
"If the relevant `WbcCapability` bit is `false`, the controller will not "
"apply that command. These bits come from the robot's OCS2 task `.info` file,"
" for example `headMidpointGaze`, `headTrackingEE`, `headCoupling`, and "
"`homeJointReference`. If the controller runs in a namespace, use its actual "
"topic names."
msgstr ""
"如果对应的 `WbcCapability` 位是 `false`，控制器不会应用这条命令。这些能力位来自机器人的 OCS2 任务 `.info` "
"文件，例如 `headMidpointGaze`、`headTrackingEE`、`headCoupling` 和 "
"`homeJointReference`。控制器带命名空间时，请使用实际的话题名。"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:209
#: e04a1e06f3d44e63a41e55f5a838ed02
msgid "Then request the mode:"
msgstr "然后请求该模式："


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:211
#: 59abd467b319465cbfa4d69b421301a2
msgid ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /mode_command std_msgs/msg/String \"data: "
"'BODY_TRACKING'\"\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /mode_command std_msgs/msg/String \"data: "
"'BODY_TRACKING'\"\n"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:215
#: 0c53f16fee904141ab895bde9991da02
msgid ""
"Replace the string with any command in the tables below. In Python, call "
"`send_mode_command(...)`, then `wait_until_mode_commands_applied(...)`. If "
"you send several modes, publish them all first, then wait once on the "
"combined list; do not wait after every command. The RViz OCS2 panel "
"publishes the same strings when the corresponding capability is enabled."
msgstr ""
"把字符串换成下表中的任意命令。在 Python 中，先调用 `send_mode_command(...)`，再调用 "
"`wait_until_mode_commands_applied(...)`。如果要发多条模式，先全部发布，再对合并后的列表等待一次，不要每条都等。能力开启时，RViz"
" 的 OCS2 面板也会发布相同的字符串。"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:217
#: 51b641a8e72a4b59af7132b070615718
msgid ""
"interface.send_fsm_command(3)  # OCS2\n"
"interface.send_mode_command(\"BODY_TRACKING\")\n"
"interface.send_mode_command(\"BASE_LOCK\")\n"
"ok = interface.wait_until_mode_commands_applied(\n"
"    [\"BODY_TRACKING\", \"BASE_LOCK\"],\n"
"    timeout=5.0,\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""
"interface.send_fsm_command(3)  # OCS2\n"
"interface.send_mode_command(\"BODY_TRACKING\")\n"
"interface.send_mode_command(\"BASE_LOCK\")\n"
"ok = interface.wait_until_mode_commands_applied(\n"
"    [\"BODY_TRACKING\", \"BASE_LOCK\"],\n"
"    timeout=5.0,\n"
")\n"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:227
#: dcd500a946b14919aafcc06f2a52f35c
msgid ""
"When the command is accepted, the matching `current_state` field changes. "
"That reports a selected mode or an active task, not that a pose has already "
"been reached. A worked sequence is in the [mode-command check "
"example](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/examples/test/01_mode_and_fsm/check_mode_commands.py)."
" The Python mapping is `MODE_COMMAND_TO_WBC_EXPECT` in the "
"[API_REFERENCE](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/API_REFERENCE.md)."
msgstr ""
"命令被接受后，对应的 `current_state` "
"字段会改变。这表示已选中某个模式，或某项任务已激活，不表示位姿已经到达。完整示例见[模式命令检查脚本](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/examples/test/01_mode_and_fsm/check_mode_commands.py)。Python"
" 中的映射是 [API_REFERENCE](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/API_REFERENCE.md) 里的 "
"`MODE_COMMAND_TO_WBC_EXPECT`。"


