msgid ""
"`head_tracking_ee_enabled`, from the `headTrackingEE` section. After this "
"mode is on, publish a target on `/head_target` or `/head_target/stamped`; "
"otherwise the head will not move."
msgstr ""
"`head_tracking_ee_enabled`，来自 `headTrackingEE` 段。进入该模式后，还需要向 `/head_target` "
"或 `/head_target/stamped` 发布目标，否则头部不会运动。"


