#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:176
#: 8c5d2201cc4041669ffdd09520e2377e
msgid ""
"`head_midpoint_gaze_enabled`, from the top-level `headMidpointGaze` section "
"(`activate`, `cameraFrame`, and the camera parameters). This reports an "
"active task, not that the head is already aligned or that the target is "
"reachable."
msgstr ""
"`head_midpoint_gaze_enabled`，来自顶层 `headMidpointGaze` "
"段（`activate`、`cameraFrame` 以及相机参数）。这表示任务已激活，不表示头部已经对准，也不表示目标可达。"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:176
#: 9df65f07b889405c97fefb6fd8800cd0
