#: bd4cf4f36a2f4fec8db00cba671833b9
msgid "`head_state` = `3` (`HEAD_FORWARD`)"
msgstr "`head_state` = `3` (`HEAD_FORWARD`)"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:176
#: 0f9379dea35a492586d3bcb410c73394
msgid ""
"`has_head_coupling`, from the `headCoupling` section. In this mode, "
"`body_state` still reports the body mode you selected, but the former lock-"
"head constraints temporarily override it. Leaving `HEAD_FORWARD` restores "
"that body selection."
msgstr ""
"`has_head_coupling`，来自 `headCoupling` 段。在此模式下，`body_state` "
"仍回报你选择的身体模式，但会暂时被原来的锁头约束覆盖。退出 `HEAD_FORWARD` 后，该身体选择会恢复。"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:257
#: 8680d58500014cd8a6eba62b9435318c
msgid "Arms"
