#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:259
#: bff6358da0a14f7d93bb6eee07c824bf
msgid ""
"Switch a single arm only while the arms are independent. If they are already"
" coupled, `LEFT_ARM_*` and `RIGHT_ARM_*` are ignored. `ARMS_COUPLED` is "
"accepted only when both arms are enabled."
msgstr ""
"只有在双臂独立时才能切换单臂使能。如果已经耦合，`LEFT_ARM_*` 和 `RIGHT_ARM_*` 会被忽略。只有左右臂都已启用时，才会接受 "
"`ARMS_COUPLED`。"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:176
#: 07e3dd9632eb4a2ab4e1783580012efc
