#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:268
#: 39c18b0d5e77497bba29f4d0069f0c89
msgid "HOME joint reference"
msgstr "HOME 关节参考"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:270
#: ee06596c3a204268806fa8e4df202c0c
msgid ""
"`HOME_JOINT_ON` and `HOME_JOINT_OFF` turn the HOME joint-reference "
"constraint on or off. This is a constraint switch, not a report that the FSM"
" is in HOME. Confirm it on `home_joint_reference_enabled`. The constraint "
"can be applied while the FSM is in HOLD, MOVEJ, or OCS2, but the usual "
"sequence is still to enter OCS2 first."
msgstr ""
"`HOME_JOINT_ON` 和 `HOME_JOINT_OFF` 用于打开或关闭 HOME 关节参考约束。这是约束开关，并不表示 FSM 处于 "
"HOME。请在 `home_joint_reference_enabled` 上确认。该约束可以在 FSM 处于 HOLD、MOVEJ 或 OCS2 "
"时应用，但通常仍建议先进入 OCS2。"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:272
#: 3b1753a067164693905ce5af5abec48a
msgid ""
"The capability bit is `has_home_joint_reference`, from the "
"`homeJointReference` section. If that bit is `false`, the controller ignores"
" the command. If `HOME_JOINT_ON` is rejected, for example because the "
"current home reference is outside the URDF joint limits, "
"`home_joint_reference_enabled` stays `false`."
msgstr ""
"对应的能力位是 `has_home_joint_reference`，来自 `homeJointReference` 段。如果该位为 "
"`false`，控制器会忽略这条命令。如果 `HOME_JOINT_ON` 被拒绝，例如当前 HOME 参考超出了 URDF "
"关节限位，`home_joint_reference_enabled` 会保持为 `false`。"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:274
#: b9c994fce5ee47da9531f8f4a1648e8a
msgid ""
"The controller also accepts body presets of the form `PRESET:HM_*`. Those "
"change the body, arms, and base together and leave the current head mode "
"unchanged. Confirm the result on `current_state`; the Python mapping does "
"not list these preset names."
msgstr ""
"控制器也接受形如 `PRESET:HM_*` 的身体预设。它们会同时改变身体、双臂和底盘，并保留当前的头部模式。请在 `current_state` "
"上确认结果；Python 映射里没有列出这些预设名。"

#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:209
#: 010650206c5042a2b1dd975be7644a91
msgid ""
"For a controller that is already running, enter OCS2 if needed, then request"
" the mode and inspect the feedback:"
msgstr "控制器已运行时，如有需要先进入 OCS2，再请求模式并查看反馈："


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:211
#: e6e0a2d6845e4f33b219652956df6251
msgid ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 3\"\n"
"ros2 topic pub --once /mode_command std_msgs/msg/String \"data: 'BODY_TRACKING'\"\n"
"ros2 topic echo /ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 3\"\n"
"ros2 topic pub --once /mode_command std_msgs/msg/String \"data: 'BODY_TRACKING'\"\n"
"ros2 topic echo /ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state\n"


#: ../../workspace/docs-wbc-current-state-20261119/source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:229
#: dcd500a946b14919aafcc06f2a52f35c
msgid ""
"When the command is accepted, the matching `current_state` field changes. "
"That reports a selected mode or an active task, not that a pose has already "
"been reached. A worked sequence is in the [mode-command check "
"example](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/examples/test/01_mode_and_fsm/check_mode_commands.py)."
" The current Python mapping is `MODE_COMMAND_TO_WBC_EXPECT` in the "
"[interface source](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/ros2_robot_interface/ros_interface.py)."
msgstr ""
"命令被接受后，对应的 `current_state` "
"字段会改变。这表示已选中某个模式，或某项任务已激活，不表示位姿已经到达。完整示例见[模式命令检查脚本](https://github.com/fiveages-"
